event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":81,"item_id":"rs_07a94eab238b4c48016ac91eb53cbc81968937d36aed93d940","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Refining testing procedures**\n\nI'm considering the best way to extend existing single test task checks before restarting. It might require me to redefine certain details while ensuring any captured content is recorded correctly after the tasks. A simpler approach could be reusing the current test for adding steps, capturing the original details before restarting. I want to make sure that the projects remain unaffected during this process — definitely something to keep in mind!"}

